WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.993 --> 00:00:08.287
Every channel plays into its own insert on the Mixer. Drag a fader to set its level.

2
00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:13.617
Click an insert, then Add effect in its chain on the right, and pick Krypt EQ.

3
00:00:16.123 --> 00:00:19.606
Drag a numbered band on the curve to boost or cut that range.

4
00:00:20.495 --> 00:00:24.628
Krypt Comp on the kick shows its gain reduction live while the beat plays.

5
00:00:28.388 --> 00:00:31.825
Chains loads a whole ready-made effect chain in one click.

6
00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:39.330
Or open Auto Mix and let Krypt set the whole mix for you.
